"Session export/import (the session is still saved/loaded automatically)."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:450
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"More functions. Although many functions that aren't built-in can be "
"simulated. "
"For instance, to take the logarithm of x to a different base (b), you could "
"do "
"(ln x / ln b). And the x<superscript>th</superscript> "
"root of a number is just that number raised to the (1 / x) power."
msgstr ""

